    "slot_value": "The system must report that it is not controlling the equipment at the moment, stay in a safe inactive state when inactive or reset, avoid making any active heating or cooling requests, and remain inactive if there is uncertainty about sensor readings or equipment status until that uncertainty clears. If a device or input becomes unavailable or inconsistent during operation, it should flag the issue immediately, show which device or input has gone bad, and if control confidence is affected, switch to a safe degraded mode and tell the operator that manual attention is needed.",
    "operation": "refine"
